  "coverage_decisions": [
    "All 146 formal guideline recommendation identifiers in the summary were atomized once.",
    "All 21 main guideline figures and all 24 main guideline tables were inventoried. Load-bearing risk frameworks, the hematuria workflow, and the pregnancy table were checked against rendered pages.",
    "The 2020 CJASN article was treated as a companion implementation source because it explains the 2017 framework using a checklist and five patient scenarios. It was not treated as a 2020 update of the guideline evidence search.",
    "The main guideline bibliography and the companion bibliography were extracted to a separate Markdown artifact and were not atomized.",
    "Underlying trial and observational results summarized by the guideline remain secondary evidence in SEA. They were not promoted to primary-study LiteratureAtoms."
  ],
